{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-09-27 00:01:00', 'title': "EGYPT'S MINISTRY OF SUPPLY AND INTERNAL TRADE AUTOMATES WHEAT SILOS PROCESSES IN COLLABORATION WITH IBM AND ACME SAICO", 'text': 'CAIRO, SEPT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE:\xa0IBM), IN COLLABORATION WITH BUSINESS PARTNER ACME SAICO, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE AUTOMATION OF 22 WHEAT SILOS ACROSS EGYPT BY THE END OF THIS YEAR\xa0USING IBM AI-POWERED AUTOMATION SOFTWARE.'}